
The version of ADK located here has been modified for use in the STS Product flow.
Only the files required to run the tools are provided. 

The following directories contain the libraries. 

tessent     <-- Tessent Library with attributes
verilog     <-- Verilog library
synopsys    <-- Synopsys synthesis library
liberty     <-- Liberty used to create Synopsys .db and Tessent BIST Libraries
leonardo    <-- Leonardo synthesis library


